    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Tenpōrin'in] to the Saint and every ally in the emanation.</p><p>You gain a status bonus to Will saves and to saves against mental effects, and you are immune to the <strong>fascinated</strong> and <strong>frightened</strong> conditions.</p><p>The bonus is +1, +2 from the Saint's 12th level, and +3 from their 18th — and the immunity extends to <strong>confused</strong> from 12th. All four numbers are the <em>caster's</em>, not yours, so they are written in when the wheel turns rather than read off your own sheet. Below 12th level the confused immunity carries a predicate nothing satisfies, which is how it stays switched off.</p>"
        },
